%% State 08 — Project status field
%% Updated 2026-07-27.
%% Evidence status: Partial lifecycle. Four values are enforced; transition order is not.
%% Evidence: ProjectStatus enum, project_state_rules.ts, project update DTO/command.

stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    state CreateStatus <<choice>>
    [*] --> CreateStatus : createProject / validate status
    CreateStatus --> pending : [omitted or pending]
    CreateStatus --> in_progress : [status = in_progress]
    CreateStatus --> completed : [status = completed]
    CreateStatus --> cancelled : [status = cancelled]

    state UpdateStatus <<choice>>

    pending --> UpdateStatus : updateStatus(value)
    in_progress --> UpdateStatus : updateStatus(value)
    completed --> UpdateStatus : updateStatus(value)
    cancelled --> UpdateStatus : updateStatus(value)

    UpdateStatus --> pending : [value = pending]
    UpdateStatus --> in_progress : [value = in_progress]
    UpdateStatus --> completed : [value = completed]
    UpdateStatus --> cancelled : [value = cancelled]

    note right of UpdateStatus
        CreateProjectDTO accepts any ProjectStatus value;
        pending is only the omitted-status default.
        Update validates enum membership only. No ordered
        transition policy exists, so any current value may
        change to any accepted value, including itself.
    end note
